# Wealthfolio PostgreSQL Migrations

This folder contains Diesel migrations for PostgreSQL/Supabase.

**Note**: The actual migrations are managed via Supabase dashboard or CLI.
The migration file `20250124000000_wealthfolio_tables.sql` is in the Orus project:
`orus-reference/supabase/migrations/20250124000000_wealthfolio_tables.sql`

For local development, you can use Diesel CLI to manage migrations:

```bash
# Set DATABASE_URL
export DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres:password@localhost:5432/wealthfolio"

# Run migrations
diesel migration run
```
